WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
A driven wheel turns the motor during regenerative braking.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The motor acts as a generator.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Power electronics direct current toward the battery.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Energy recovery is partial; conversion has losses.
